# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says. The one-line installers
# embed packages/m0s/m0s.mjs verbatim (sh breaks on CRLF), the tests import scripts/*.mjs and parse
# frontmatter, and a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true used to turn three of them red (29.09).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# The coordinate skill is vendored byte-identical into the mosadd-agent repo
# (skills/mosadd-coordinate/SKILL.md there). Disable EOL normalization so
# CRLF/LF can never silently break the byte-identical contract.
skills/mosadd-coordinate/SKILL.md -text
